## Development & testing

Managed with [copier](https://copier.readthedocs.io/) + [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):

```bash
uv sync          # install dev toolchain
make lint        # yamllint + ansible-lint
{% if include_docker %}make test        # molecule test — docker scenario (fast)
{% endif %}{% if include_vagrant %}make test-vm     # molecule test — vagrant/libvirt scenario (needs KVM)
{% endif %}```

Pull future template improvements:

```bash
copier update --trust
```
