## Release notes

Before pushing a `v*` tag, edit or create the matching manual note:

```bash
$EDITOR .release-notes/v0.1.0.md
git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0
```

`Summary` and `Upgrade Notes` are maintained in `.release-notes/<tag>.md`; `Changes` is generated from git history by git-cliff.
